Hi!

The python client and library got some smaller bug fixes.

python-linstor 1.0.13
---------------------
 * Fix key value store API access
 * Resource class allow to only spawn definitions

https://www.linbit.com/downloads/linstor/python-linstor-1.0.13.tar.gz

linstor-client 1.0.13
---------------------
 * Fix property setting if key with = is given
 * Add auto-place command to resource-definition

https://www.linbit.com/downloads/linstor/linstor-client-1.0.13.tar.gz

Linstor PPA:
https://launchpad.net/~linbit/+archive/ubuntu/linbit-drbd9-stack

Best regards,
Rene

